# RetroArch saves. The tree is per-game and Dolphin keeps a whole emulator
# profile inside each game folder, so caches, configs, logs, dumps, texture
# packs and console system files are excluded. SRAM (.srm, .raw) and memory
# card saves (.gci) are kept.

- */User/Cache/**
- */User/Config/**
- */User/Logs/**
- */User/Dump/**
- */User/ScreenShots/**
- */User/Shaders/**
- */User/Load/**
- */User/ResourcePacks/**
- */User/Styles/**
- */User/Themes/**
- */User/Maps/**
- */User/Triforce/**
- */User/WFS/**
- */User/Wii/tmp/**
- */User/Wii/import/**
- */User/Wii/meta/**
- */User/Wii/ticket/**
- */User/Wii/sys/**
- */User/Wii/wfs/**
- */User/Wii/shared1/**
- */User/Wii/shared2/**
- */User/Wii/fst.bin
- *.uidcache
- *.cache
- *.log
- *.txt
